# Auto-regenerated AI instruction files — the Continuity extension rewrites these
# in any workspace it activates against, including this fixture. setup-mcp.sh
# strips them on every recording run, but the regenerator races, leaving them
# in a constant D-status churn. Untracked here so the fixture stays sanitized.
